This README file contains information on the contents of the meta-face_detection layer.

Please see the corresponding sections below for details.

Table of Contents
=================

  I. Adding the meta-face_detection layer to your build
 II. Purpose


I. Adding the meta-face_detection layer to your build
=================================================

Run 'bitbake-layers add-layer meta-face_detection'


II. Purpose
============

Face Detection application
  This application is used to detect and identify the person with their name.
  
  Uses pre-trained face detection models (e.g., Haar cascades) to identify faces.

  Draws bounding boxes around detected faces for visualization.

  Outputs the image or stream with marked faces.
